    "Anything long-running you started in Terminal, iTerm, Warp, Ghostty, or an editor's built-in terminal. Watchers and dev servers are ignored, since they never finish.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anything long-running you started in Terminal, iTerm, Warp, Ghostty, or an editor's built-in terminal. Watchers and dev servers are ignored, since they never finish."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在终端、iTerm、Warp、Ghostty 或编辑器内置终端中启动的长时间运行命令。持续监听任务和开发服务器不会结束，因此会被忽略。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在「終端機」、iTerm、Warp、Ghostty 或編輯器內建終端機中啟動的長時間執行命令。監看程序和開發伺服器永遠不會結束，因此會被忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
