    "App is blurred while blocked. Notifications stay visible and the app stays open, but there is no unblock button, although you can end the session anytime.": {
      "comment": "FocusIntensity.blurb",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App is blurred while blocked. Notifications stay visible and the app stays open, but there is no unblock button, although you can end the session anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏蔽期间，应用画面会被模糊处理，通知仍然显示，应用保持打开。没有解除屏蔽按钮，但你可以随时结束专注时段。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "封鎖期間，App 畫面會模糊處理。通知仍會顯示，App 也會保持打開，但沒有解除封鎖按鈕；不過你可以隨時結束專注時段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App is blurred while blocked. Notifications stay visible, and you can unblock an app instantly with a button, the app stays open.": {
      "comment": "FocusIntensity.blurb",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App is blurred while blocked. Notifications stay visible, and you can unblock an app instantly with a button, the app stays open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏蔽期间，应用画面会被模糊处理，通知仍然显示。应用保持打开，你可以点按按钮立即解除屏蔽。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "封鎖期間，App 畫面會模糊處理。通知仍會顯示，你也可以點一下按鈕立即解除封鎖，App 會保持打開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
