    "Apple limits brightness to preserve battery life. While this feature is system-controlled and there are no known side-effects, you should use this feature at your own risk.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple limits brightness to preserve battery life. While this feature is system-controlled and there are no known side-effects, you should use this feature at your own risk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 会限制亮度以延长电池续航。虽然此功能由系统控制且暂无已知副作用，但请自行承担使用风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 會限制亮度以延長電池續航力。雖然此功能由系統控制且目前沒有已知的副作用，但使用此功能時請自行承擔風險。"
          }
        }
