    "Blocked apps are force-closed and notifications are hidden. Unblock requests wait 10 minutes (or until the session ends), and the session itself can't be stopped early.": {
      "comment": "FocusIntensity.blurb",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blocked apps are force-closed and notifications are hidden. Unblock requests wait 10 minutes (or until the session ends), and the session itself can't be stopped early."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被屏蔽的应用会被强制关闭，通知也会隐藏。解除屏蔽需等待 10 分钟或专注时段结束，且无法提前结束专注时段。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遭封鎖的 App 會被強制結束，通知也會隱藏。解除封鎖的要求需等待 10 分鐘（或直到專注時段結束），且無法提前停止專注時段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocked apps are force-closed the moment they open and notifications are hidden. No unblocking, but you can end the session anytime.": {
      "comment": "FocusIntensity.blurb",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blocked apps are force-closed the moment they open and notifications are hidden. No unblocking, but you can end the session anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被屏蔽的应用一旦打开就会被强制关闭，通知也会隐藏。无法单独解除屏蔽，但你可以随时结束专注时段。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遭封鎖的 App 一打開就會被強制結束，通知也會隱藏。無法解除封鎖，但你可以隨時結束專注時段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
