    "Miss a day without breaking your streak by reporting immunity days at least 3 days in advance (unlimited). If a streak still breaks, spend a streak pass to revive it — everyone gets a few free every month by plan.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Miss a day without breaking your streak by reporting immunity days at least 3 days in advance (unlimited). If a streak still breaks, spend a streak pass to revive it — everyone gets a few free every month by plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "至少提前 3 天申报豁免日（次数不限），当天未完成也不会中断连续记录。如果连续记录仍然中断，可使用连续记录恢复券；各订阅方案每月都会免费提供若干张。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "至少提前 3 天申報豁免日（次數不限），當天未完成也不會中斷連續紀錄。如果連續紀錄仍然中斷，可以使用連續紀錄通行證恢復；各訂閱方案每月都會免費提供幾張。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
