    "Nearby Share allows you to share files from Android phones to your Mac using Android's native file sharing (Nearby Share / Quick Share). It's recommended to keep this feature enabled for convenient sharing from family and friends.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share allows you to share files from Android phones to your Mac using Android's native file sharing (Nearby Share / Quick Share). It's recommended to keep this feature enabled for convenient sharing from family and friends."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近分享让你通过 Android 原生文件共享（Nearby Share / Quick Share）将文件从 Android 手机发送到 Mac。建议保持启用，方便与亲友共享文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share 可讓你使用 Android 原生的檔案分享功能（Nearby Share／Quick Share），將檔案從 Android 手機傳送到 Mac。建議保持啟用，方便親友分享檔案給你。"
          }
