      }
    },
    "Open the unified Sapphire picker right where you're typing with a global shortcut. Selecting a clipboard item copies it and pastes it at the cursor; the Emoji tab types emoji directly. (The emoji shortcut opens the same panel on its Emoji tab.)": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the unified Sapphire picker right where you're typing with a global shortcut. Selecting a clipboard item copies it and pastes it at the cursor; the Emoji tab types emoji directly. (The emoji shortcut opens the same panel on its Emoji tab.)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用全局快捷键，在输入位置打开 Sapphire 统一选取面板。选择剪贴板项目会将其复制并粘贴到光标处；“表情符号”标签页会直接输入表情。（表情快捷键会打开同一面板的“表情符号”标签页。）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用全域快速鍵，在你輸入文字的位置直接打開統一的 Sapphire 選擇器。選擇剪貼簿項目會將其拷貝並貼到游標處；「表情符號」標籤頁會直接輸入表情符號。（表情符號快速鍵會打開同一個面板的「表情符號」標籤頁。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open update page": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
