    "OpenBubbles is a free, open-source project that brings iMessage, FaceTime, and other Apple services to Android, Windows, and Linux. This tool generates a registration code using your Mac's hardware identifiers, allowing other devices to connect directly to Apple's services.": {
      "comment": "Compiler-extracted static interface text",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBubbles is a free, open-source project that brings iMessage, FaceTime, and other Apple services to Android, Windows, and Linux. This tool generates a registration code using your Mac's hardware identifiers, allowing other devices to connect directly to Apple's services."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBubbles 是免费的开源项目，让 Android、Windows 和 Linux 设备也能使用 iMessage、FaceTime 及其他 Apple 服务。此工具利用 Mac 的硬件标识生成注册码，让其他设备直接连接 Apple 服务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenBubbles 是免費的開放原始碼專案，可將 iMessage、FaceTime 和其他 Apple 服務帶到 Android、Windows 和 Linux。此工具會使用你 Mac 的硬體識別碼產生註冊碼，讓其他裝置能直接連線至 Apple 的服務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
