    "Position your monitor about an arm's length away and adjust the angle of the screen so that the top it is at or slightly below eye level. This reduces strain on your neck and eyes.": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Position your monitor about an arm's length away and adjust the angle of the screen so that the top it is at or slightly below eye level. This reduces strain on your neck and eyes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将显示器放在大约一臂远的位置，调整角度，使屏幕顶部与视线齐平或略低。这有助于减轻颈部和眼睛的疲劳。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將顯示器放在約一臂遠的位置，並調整螢幕角度，讓螢幕頂端與視線齊平或略低。這可減輕頸部和眼睛的負擔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
