    "Replace the switcher with a keyboard-driven, window-aware overlay. Hold the shortcut and press Tab to cycle, arrows to move, Q to quit an app, W to close a window.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Replace the switcher with a keyboard-driven, window-aware overlay. Hold the shortcut and press Tab to cycle, arrows to move, Q to quit an app, W to close a window."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用支持键盘和窗口预览的浮层替换切换器。按住快捷键，再按 Tab 循环切换、方向键移动、Q 退出应用、W 关闭窗口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以鍵盤操作、可辨識視窗的覆疊畫面取代切換器。按住快速鍵並按 Tab 循環切換、按方向鍵移動、按 Q 結束 App、按 W 關閉視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
