    "Reveal hidden menu bar items when a condition is met — battery level, active Focus, Wi-Fi network, or a script's exit code — and bind profiles to displays, Spaces, or Focus filters.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reveal hidden menu bar items when a condition is met — battery level, active Focus, Wi-Fi network, or a script's exit code — and bind profiles to displays, Spaces, or Focus filters."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "满足电量、当前专注模式、Wi-Fi 网络或脚本退出码等条件时，显示隐藏的菜单栏项目；还可将方案绑定到显示器、桌面空间或专注模式过滤条件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在符合條件時顯示隱藏的選單列項目（電池電量、目前專注模式、Wi-Fi 網路或腳本的結束代碼），並將設定組綁定至顯示器、空間或專注模式過濾條件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
