    "Sapphire automatically uses Apple's standard Clock shortcut names (\"Start Timer\", \"Start Stopwatch\", etc.). If iCloud sync is enabled and those Clock shortcuts are present on this Mac, they run automatically during sessions.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire automatically uses Apple's standard Clock shortcut names (\"Start Timer\", \"Start Stopwatch\", etc.). If iCloud sync is enabled and those Clock shortcuts are present on this Mac, they run automatically during sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 自动使用 Apple 标准时钟快捷指令名称（如“Start Timer”“Start Stopwatch”）。若已启用 iCloud 同步且此 Mac 上存在这些时钟快捷指令，它们将在专注时段内自动运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 會自動使用 Apple 標準的「時鐘」捷徑名稱（「Start Timer」、「Start Stopwatch」等）。若已啟用 iCloud 同步，且這台 Mac 上有這些「時鐘」捷徑，則會在專注時段期間自動執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
