            "value": "Sapphire 正透過應用程式符號連結執行。請先將實際的 App 移到「應用程式」檔案夾再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire isn't in a user-writable location. Install or repair the privileged helper, then use the standard install method.": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire isn't in a user-writable location. Install or repair the privileged helper, then use the standard install method."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 所在位置不允许当前用户写入。请安装或修复特权辅助工具，再使用标准安装方式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 不在使用者可寫入的位置。請安裝或修復特權輔助服務，然後使用標準安裝方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire lost connection to its system helper.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” to unregister Sapphire’s own background items, reinstall the helper, and relaunch. Other apps are not affected.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire lost connection to its system helper.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” to unregister Sapphire’s own background items, reinstall the helper, and relaunch. Other apps are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 与系统辅助服务的连接已断开。\n\n点击“重置辅助服务”可注销 Sapphire 自身的后台项目、重新安装辅助服务并重新启动应用。其他应用不会受到影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 與系統輔助服務的連線已中斷。\n\n按一下「重置輔助服務」可取消註冊 Sapphire 自己的背景項目、重新安裝輔助服務並重新啟動。其他 App 不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire needs a few permissions for its core features.": {
      "comment": "User-facing Sapphire interface text. Keep product names and interpolated user content unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
