          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 拒絕移除不安全的路徑：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire watches your own processes — nothing is read from inside an app, no accessibility permission is used, and nothing leaves the Mac.\n\nTools that only exist while they run (xcodebuild, cargo, gradle, npm run build, a command you typed) are detected the moment they start. Tools that stay resident between turns (Claude, Codex, an editor's built-in agent, a Gradle daemon) are reported only while they are actually working, which is why sensitivity exists.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire watches your own processes — nothing is read from inside an app, no accessibility permission is used, and nothing leaves the Mac.\n\nTools that only exist while they run (xcodebuild, cargo, gradle, npm run build, a command you typed) are detected the moment they start. Tools that stay resident between turns (Claude, Codex, an editor's built-in agent, a Gradle daemon) are reported only while they are actually working, which is why sensitivity exists."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 仅查看属于你的进程，不读取应用内部内容，不使用辅助功能权限，也不会将信息发送到 Mac 之外。\n\n仅在任务运行时存在的工具（xcodebuild、cargo、gradle、npm run build 或你输入的命令）会在启动时立即被检测。轮次之间仍常驻的工具（Claude、Codex、编辑器内置智能体或 Gradle 守护进程）仅在实际工作时报告活动，因此提供了灵敏度设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 只會監看你自己的程序，不會讀取 App 內部的任何內容、不使用輔助使用權限，也不會有任何資料離開這台 Mac。\n\n只在執行期間存在的工具（xcodebuild、cargo、gradle、npm run build、你輸入的指令）會在啟動時立即偵測到。在回合之間持續常駐的工具（Claude、Codex、編輯器內建的代理程式、Gradle 常駐程式）只有在實際運作時才會回報，這就是提供靈敏度設定的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
