    "This QR code contains your Mac's unique hardware data. **Scan it with the OpenBubbles app** on your other devices to register them for iMessage.": {
      "comment": "Compiler-extracted static interface text",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This QR code contains your Mac's unique hardware data. **Scan it with the OpenBubbles app** on your other devices to register them for iMessage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此二维码包含 Mac 的唯一硬件数据。请在其他设备上**使用 OpenBubbles 应用扫描**，以注册 iMessage。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
