    "This feature works best on devices with XDR displays (14in and 16in Macbook Pro's and Pro Display XDR). M4 Macbook Pro's already display this behaviour in bright environments like in direct sunlight, this feature will allow you to do it in any type of environment.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This feature works best on devices with XDR displays (14in and 16in Macbook Pro's and Pro Display XDR). M4 Macbook Pro's already display this behaviour in bright environments like in direct sunlight, this feature will allow you to do it in any type of environment."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能最适合配备 XDR 显示屏的设备（14 英寸和 16 英寸 MacBook Pro 以及 Pro Display XDR）。M4 MacBook Pro 在直射阳光等明亮环境中已具备此行为；本功能可让你在任何环境下使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能在配備 XDR 顯示器的裝置上效果最佳（14 吋與 16 吋 MacBook Pro 及 Pro Display XDR）。M4 MacBook Pro 在陽光直射等明亮環境下已有此表現，此功能可讓你在任何環境下都能達到相同效果。"
          }
        }
