          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將信任的 Wi-Fi 網路作為位置。在其他網路上或無法取得網路名稱時，Face ID 不會啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use your own image or video on the desktop. A video plays behind your desktop icons and pauses whenever the desktop is covered. The lock screen shows it too unless it has its own wallpaper.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use your own image or video on the desktop. A video plays behind your desktop icons and pauses whenever the desktop is covered. The lock screen shows it too unless it has its own wallpaper."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在桌面上使用你自己的图像或视频。视频在桌面图标后方播放，桌面被遮挡时暂停。锁定屏幕也会使用它，除非已单独设置墙纸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在桌面上使用你自己的影像或影片。影片會在桌面圖像後方播放，並在桌面被遮住時暫停。鎖定畫面也會顯示它，除非鎖定畫面有自己的背景圖片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses its own signed updater — Sapphire will open the app.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses its own signed updater — Sapphire will open the app."
