    "WARNING: All these features are in development and may not work as expected. They might cause unexpected unlocks on your mac. Use at your own risk.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WARNING: All these features are in development and may not work as expected. They might cause unexpected unlocks on your mac. Use at your own risk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告：这些功能均在开发中，可能无法按预期工作，并可能导致 Mac 意外解锁。使用风险由你自行承担。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告：這些功能皆在開發中，可能無法如預期運作，並可能導致你的 Mac 意外解鎖。使用風險自負。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WARNING: This method uses Spotify’s internal APIs to unlock standard and additional features for both Premium and non-Premium users. Use at your own risk, usage may be subject to Spotify’s Terms of Service.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WARNING: This method uses Spotify’s internal APIs to unlock standard and additional features for both Premium and non-Premium users. Use at your own risk, usage may be subject to Spotify’s Terms of Service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告：此方式使用 Spotify 内部 API，为 Premium 和免费用户提供标准功能及额外功能。请自行承担使用风险，并遵守 Spotify 服务条款。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告：此方式使用 Spotify 的內部 API，為 Premium 與非 Premium 使用者解鎖標準及額外功能。使用風險自負，使用行為可能受 Spotify 服務條款約束。"
