    "Wakes the Mac briefly (display stays off) at a set interval to record battery state and re-assert your charge limit overnight. Sleep is never disabled.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wakes the Mac briefly (display stays off) at a set interval to record battery state and re-assert your charge limit overnight. Sleep is never disabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按设定间隔短暂唤醒 Mac（显示器保持关闭），记录电池状态并在夜间重新应用充电上限。不会禁用睡眠。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依設定的間隔短暫喚醒 Mac（顯示器保持關閉），以記錄電池狀態並在夜間重新套用你的充電上限。絕不會停用睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
