          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 丢失了辅助服务（状态 3）。请重置辅助服务；如果仍未恢复，Sapphire 将重新启动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 遺失了輔助服務（狀態 3）。請重置輔助服務；若仍卡住，Sapphire 將重新啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS lost the helper registration (SAP-H3). Tap Reset Helper to rebuild it; Sapphire relaunches itself if the helper stays stuck.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
